From c8ae949d88f9d8f3088f4c720494872693a4cfce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MiaAI-Lab <MiaAI-Lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 14:40:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] glm: neon N1 prefill candidates behind policy bits 11-14 and
 bit 4 for bf16 projections

bit 11: tf_glm_dsa_scores_w8 (8 warps, a prompt row a warp in registers; tf_glm_dsa_scores_r8's bits)
bit 12: glm_mm8_p128x64 / p64x128 prompt tilings of glm_mm8_128s2's sums, picked by shape and rows
bit 13: tf_glm_msa_w576_i8_f3 / dense_i8_f3 (bf16-pair int8 dequant, three CTAs an SM; the same bits)
bit 14: tf_glm_router_fused (router slices summed in registers, slice_sum's order) from 512 rows
bit 4: ownerProjects allows tiled bf16 / packed projections (one K slice in prompts)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UQVvNj5qARY3iLJfisqfnh
