 // glm_moe_dsa's split [q_a | kv_a] in a decode window: every rank's columns gathered as [world][rows][cw] slots, rank
 // q's slot holding [rows][n_q] (n_q = min(cw, total - q cw): its columns q cw ..), back into dst [rows][total] (rows
